              plying  a  negative  _i_n_c but has insufficient privileges.  Under
              Linux, the CCAAPP__SSYYSS__NNIICCEE capability is required.   (But  see  the
              discussion of the RRLLIIMMIITT__NNIICCEE resource limit in sseettrrlliimmiitt(2).)

